          "ihh:quote": "Won the Electronic Frontier Foundation (EFF) Pioneer Award (1997)",
          "ihh:locator": "line 92, Awards & Honors list item 2"
        },
        {
          "ihh:source": {
            "@id": "ihh:LAM-S-0016"
          },
          "ihh:quote": "The Electronic Frontier Foundation jointly awarded Lamarr and Antheil with their Pioneer Award in 1997.",
          "ihh:locator": "paragraph beginning \"Meanwhile, Lamarr’s patent expired\""
        },
        {
          "ihh:source": {
            "@id": "ihh:LAM-S-0013"
          },
          "ihh:quote": "In 1997, Lamarr and Antheil were jointly honored with the Electronic Frontier Foundation’s Pioneer Award. Lamarr’s son accepted the award on her behalf",
          "ihh:locator": "paragraph 18"
        },
        {
          "ihh:source": {
            "@id": "ihh:LAM-S-0044"
          },
          "ihh:quote": "She recruited George Antheil, a composer she met through MGM Studios",
