      "ihh:notes": "Fact research lamarr-citizen-2026-11-01 (owner: find at least a naturalization year). A dated contemporary Library of Congress page (AP item, Evening star, April 11, 1953) reports that Lamarr has taken the oath in a court ceremony. event_date is the year only: the item says the oath has been taken (the April 10 page, LAM-S-0063, says she gets her citizenship that day), so the publication day is not used as the event day. Same year as LAM-F-0112 (NARA caption of the naturalization card dated April 10, 1953, and The National WWII Museum) and LAM-F-0016.\n2026-11-02 (owner ruling: the year must rest on a source that states it): corroborating evidence attached from LAM-F-0112's sources, LAM-S-0013 ('would not be naturalized until 1953') and the LAM-S-0044 NARA card caption ('April 10, 1953'). event_date stays the year only."
