      "description": "Discovery for media. Extmetadata read for ~27 files. Credits naming a holder were followed: three Los Angeles Times photos credit UCLA Library pages (staged from UCLA, the holder). Most portrait and film-still files credit eBay, IMDb, Tumblr, Flickr or fan magazines (Screenland, Modern Screen) with no holder record: not staged. Yank (U.S. Army) pin-ups credit a magazine issue or 306bg.us, no holder page: not staged. Patent-page scans and the 'Signature of Hedy Kiesler Markey' crop come from NARA via DPLA (NAID 167820368), covered by the NARA record itself (LAM-M-0001). Murals, graves duplicates, Exeter building, street-name audio and social-media graphics left out as low value."
    },
